                in
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anomalous+magnetic+moment"} anomalous magnetic moment
                of
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/muon"} muon
                and
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/electron"} electron
          %h3#InStringPhenomenology Occurrence in string phenomenology
          %p
            Discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+phenomenology"} string phenomenology
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/intersecting+D-brane+models"} intersecting D-brane models
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactification"} KK-compactified
            with non-geometric
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fibers"} fibers
            such that the would-be string
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sigma-models"} sigma-models
            with these
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/target+spaces"} target spaces
            are in fact
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gepner+models"} Gepner models
            (in the sense of
            = succeed ")" do
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://www.physicsforums.com/insights/spectral-standard-model-string-compactifications/"} Spectral Standard Model and String Compactifications
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#DijkstraHuiszoonSchellekens04a"} Dijkstra-Huiszoon-Schellekens 04a
            = succeed "):" do
              %a{:href => "#DijkstraHuiszoonSchellekens04b"} Dijkstra-Huiszoon-Schellekens 04b
          %center
            %img{:src => "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/files/SchellekensSuperGepnerModelScanII.jpg", :width => "600"}/
          %blockquote
            %p
              A plot of
              = succeed "-like" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/standard+model+of+particle+physics"} standard model
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coupling+constants"} coupling constants
